{"id":"avtograf","lemma":"автограф","pos":"noun","rank":3538,"glosses":["autograph, signature"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f8/Ru-%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%84.ogg/Ru-%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%84.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"автографа","plural":"автографы"},"examples":[{"text":"Можно взять у вас автограф?","en":"Can I get your autograph?","words":[{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},null]},{"text":"Я могу дать тебе автограф, если ты хочешь.","en":"I can give you an autograph if you want.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to give"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"if, in case"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]},{"text":"Можно мне Ваш автограф?","en":"Can I have your autograph?","words":[{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"your, yours"},null]},{"text":"Я могу дать вам автограф, если вы хотите.","en":"I can give you an autograph if you want.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to give"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null,{"g":"if, in case"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]},{"text":"После концерта Том раздавал автографы.","en":"After the concert, Tom signed autographs.","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"concert","l":"концерт"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null]}]}